<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to MediConnect</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f7f9;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #007bff;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px 20px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px 25px;
            color: #333333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .content h2 {
            color: #007bff;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #777777;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>MediConnect</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Welcome aboard!</h2>
            <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
            <p>Welcome to <strong>MediConnect</strong>! We are thrilled to have you with us. Your account has been created successfully.</p>
            <p>With MediConnect, you can easily manage your healthcare needs, book appointments with top doctors, and keep track of your health records securely.</p>
            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>
            <br>
            <p>Best Regards,<br><strong>The MediConnect Team</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> MediConnect. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>